# Specify files that shouldn't be modified by Fern
README.md
.github/assets/logo.png

# Hand-written agent workflows-as-code builder (docs/agents-as-code/workflow-spec.md in
# elevenlabs-js): a layer on top of the generated client that the generator does not emit. It
# builds the generated types.AgentWorkflowRequestModel and passes the shared cross-SDK fixtures
# (vendored in agentworkflows/testdata/fixtures).
agentworkflows/

# Hand-written agent tools-as-code builder (docs/agents-as-code/tool-spec.md in elevenlabs-js):
# webhook, client and system tools on top of the generated client, which the generator does not
# emit. It builds the generated types.ToolRequestModel, reuses the workflow builder's Destination
# and passes the shared cross-SDK fixtures (vendored in agenttools/testdata/fixtures).
agenttools/

# Hand-written canonical JSON writer (sorted keys, JavaScript number and string formatting) shared
# by the agents-as-code builders. It sits in the module's internal/ tree so the workflow and tools
# builders can import it without making it public API.
internal/wirejson/
